{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Moses came.</b> To the camp of Israel, and there is no need to mention that he went down." "<b>And he set before them.</b> Like \"and this is the Torah which Moses set\" (Deuteronomy 4:44). And the Gaon [Saadia] said that it is in the manner of \"set it in their mouths\" (Deuteronomy 31:19), and the meaning is the Oral Torah, which is the interpretation of the Written Torah."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:47.662850701Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}